     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Localization of the DRRM Policy and Strategic Action Plan at the Provincial level.
2. Disaster Information Management System (DIMS) operational and disaster data updated</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP CDRMP has been instrumental in assisting all seven provincial governments under leadership of respective Ministry of Internal Affairs and Law (MoIAL) with participation of all Ministries at province level and stakeholders, in formulating their DRR Policy and Strategic Action Plans, in line with national level DRR Policy and Strategic Action Plans. The same has been delivered at local government levels in some 16 paalikas across the country as a pilot intervention, to be rolled out to all 753 LGs over the years. Likewise, additional five paalikas were also assisted for coming up with a total of 15 ward level local disaster and climate risk management plans. The Policy and Strategic Action Plan formulation process has been instrumental in initiating risk informed development planning in the provinces and paalikas.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
